# EXPECTED-TO-FAIL — TODO.md §2, "`^s e` draws nothing on Codex"
#
# docs/NATIVE-AGENTS.md §7 — the reasoning-effort options are discovered per model from
#   `model/list.supportedReasoningEfforts`, with the harness's own `description` strings, and
#   Fleet must never hardcode a Codex ladder
# docs/KEYMAP.md §Native agent thread — `^s e` opens the reasoning / traits menu
# docs/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md §4 — a picker with nothing to offer draws nothing
#
# The adapter now calls and paginates `model/list`, preserving each effort description and the
# model's default, and it calls `skills/list`. The normalized session event/view still has no
# field for model descriptors, however, so `AgentThreadView::trait_candidates` returns no rows.
# The empty menu remains the *correct* degradation, which is exactly why nothing about it is
# visible: the picker paints no harness target and the snapshot has no field for it.
#
# The oracle is therefore the one a user feels. An open picker owns `Enter` — `send` calls
# `accept_completion` first — so with a menu open the composer's draft is kept and nothing is
# sent. With no menu, `Enter` falls straight through and the draft is sent to the agent.
#
# Fails today at the `assert` below, and only there: a turn starts and stops at the transcript's
# approval, so `state` is `needs_you` and `pending_gate` is `permission` instead of an untouched
# idle thread. Populating the effort vocabulary flips it green — and the two lines after it then
# prove the draft survived the menu.
fixture: agents
await idle
key o
await screen == Workspace 20000

key ctrl-s A
await agents.threads[0].provider == codex 20000
assert lists.tabs.selected.badges[0] == codex && agents.threads[0].state == idle && focused == agents.composer
await idle 30000
type apply the README fix

key ctrl-s e
key enter
wait 3000
assert agents.threads[0].state == idle && agents.threads[0].pending_gate absent
dump effort-menu-kept-the-draft

# Only reached once the menu exists: the draft it kept is still there to be sent.
key enter
await agents.threads[0].pending_gate == permission 30000
dump draft-survived
quit
